1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Man: Are you going to the supermarket today by any chance?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,020
Woman: I was just there yesterday. Why?

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:13,710
Man: I suddenly remembered that I'm supposed to bring some drinks to my team's lunch meeting tomorrow at work,

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:18,170
and I'm in the middle of a project I need to finish tonight.

5
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:22,120
Woman: You're in luck. I stocked up yesterday.
